    <string name="tv_panel_double">Double-Press Menu: Quick Panel</string>
    <string name="tv_panel_double_hint">Pressing Menu twice opens a panel over the screen: scenes, input, picture mode, sound output, volume, screen off, a sleep timer and turning the TV off. A single press still opens the TV’s own settings, but waits a third of a second to see whether a second press follows. Switch this off and a single press acts at once.</string>
